msgid ""
"  codecs web   Web video in Firefox only. Replaces Fedora's empty OpenH264 stand-in with\n"
"               Cisco's OpenH264 from Fedora's Cisco repository, under Cisco's own H.264\n"
"               patent license.\n"
"  codecs full  Everything. Replaces Fedora's free ffmpeg libraries with the full ffmpeg,\n"
"               x264 and x265 from RPM Fusion, the source standard Fedora uses."
msgstr ""
"  codecs web   Video web dalam Firefox sahaja. Menggantikan pengganti OpenH264 Fedora yang kosong dengan\n"
"               OpenH264 Cisco daripada repositori Cisco Fedora, di bawah lesen paten H.264\n"
"               Cisco sendiri.\n"
"  codecs full  Semuanya. Menggantikan pustaka ffmpeg bebas Fedora dengan ffmpeg penuh,\n"
"               x264 dan x265 daripada RPM Fusion, sumber yang digunakan oleh Fedora standard."

msgid ""
"  evenkeel-os-packages install [FILE]   install an .rpm or .deb (no FILE: pick one from Downloads)\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages remove           remove an app installed this way\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages check FILE       say what a package needs, without installing anything\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages repair           set a broken app box up again (--if-broken: only if one does not work)\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages login            choose box apps that start when you log in\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages windows FILE     a Windows .exe or .msi: offer a Linux app that does its job\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages check-windows FILE  say what a Windows file is and what would be offered, without any window\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages zoom LINK        a Zoom \"open the app\" link: open the meeting in Zoom's web version, in Chrome\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages vpn [NAME]       add a VPN from its company's own download source (mullvad, proton, ivpn,\n"
"                                        nordvpn; no NAME: pick one)"
msgstr ""
"  evenkeel-os-packages install [FILE]   pasang fail .rpm atau .deb (tiada FILE: pilih satu daripada Muat Turun)\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages remove           buang aplikasi yang dipasang dengan cara ini\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages check FILE       beritahu apa yang diperlukan oleh pakej, tanpa memasang apa-apa\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages repair           sediakan semula kotak aplikasi yang rosak (--if-broken: hanya jika ada yang tidak berfungsi)\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages login            pilih aplikasi kotak yang dimulakan apabila anda log masuk\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages windows FILE     fail .exe atau .msi Windows: tawarkan aplikasi Linux yang melakukan tugasnya\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages check-windows FILE  terangkan apa itu fail Windows dan apa yang akan ditawarkan, tanpa sebarang tetingkap\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages zoom LINK        pautan \"buka aplikasi\" Zoom: buka mesyuarat dalam versi web Zoom, di Chrome\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages vpn [NAME]       tambah VPN daripada sumber muat turun syarikatnya sendiri (mullvad, proton, ivpn,\n"
"                                        nordvpn; tiada NAME: pilih satu)"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\"{name}\" comes with Fedora. The trusted list is rebuilt from Fedora's "
"current list at every start, so an update replaces or drops it; keep "
"automatic updates on. If this alert stays after updating and restarting, tell"
" your helper."
msgstr ""
"\"{name}\" disertakan dengan Fedora. Senarai dipercayai dibina semula "
"daripada senarai Fedora semasa pada setiap permulaan, jadi kemas kini akan "
"menggantikannya atau membuangnya; pastikan kemas kini automatik dihidupkan. "
"Jika amaran ini masih ada selepas dikemas kini dan dimulakan semula, beritahu"
" pembantu anda."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\"{name}\" has expired, but its file ({file}) holds {n} certificate, and "
"removing it would remove them all, the good ones too. Tell your helper."
msgid_plural ""
"\"{name}\" has expired, but its file ({file}) holds {n} certificates, and "
"removing it would remove them all, the good ones too. Tell your helper."
msgstr[0] ""
"\"{name}\" telah tamat tempoh, tetapi failnya ({file}) mengandungi {n} sijil,"
" dan jika ia dibuang, semua sijil akan dibuang sekali, termasuk yang masih "
"sah. Beritahu pembantu anda."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\"{name}\" has expired. It was added in a way Wheelhouse can't remove; tell "
"your helper."
msgstr ""
"\"{name}\" telah tamat tempoh. Ia telah ditambah dengan cara yang Wheelhouse "
"tidak boleh buang; beritahu pembantu anda."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "\"{name}\" is removed and no longer trusted."
msgstr "\"{name}\" telah dibuang dan tidak lagi dipercayai."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\"{name}\" was added to this computer and expired on {date}. An expired "
"certificate shouldn't be relied on. Remove it if you no longer need it; if "
"you do, ask whoever gave it to you for a new one. Removing it needs your "
"password."
msgstr ""
"\"{name}\" telah ditambah pada komputer ini dan telah tamat tempoh pada "
"{date}. Sijil yang telah tamat tempoh tidak boleh dipercayai. Buang jika anda"
" tidak memerlukannya lagi; jika anda memerlukannya, minta sijil baharu "
"daripada orang yang memberikannya kepada anda. Untuk membuangnya, anda perlu "
"memasukkan kata laluan anda."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\"{name}\" was added to this computer and expires on {date}. Ask whoever gave"
" it to you for a new one before then."
msgstr ""
"\"{name}\" telah ditambah pada komputer ini dan akan tamat tempoh pada "
"{date}. Minta yang baharu daripada orang yang memberikannya kepada anda "
"sebelum tarikh itu."

#. Translators: a weekday and date ("Thursday, November 26"). Uses strftime codes.
msgid "%A, %B %-d"
msgstr "%A, %-d %B"

#. Translators: a date: month and day ("November 26"). Uses strftime codes.
msgid "%B %-d"
msgstr "%-d %B"

#. Translators: a date and a 12-hour time ("November 26, 7:02 PM"). Uses strftime codes.
msgid "%B %-d, %-I:%M %p"
msgstr "%-d %B, %-I:%M %p"

#. Translators: a date and a 24-hour time ("November 26, 19:02"). Uses strftime codes.
msgid "%B %-d, %H:%M"
msgstr "%-d %B, %H:%M"

msgid "(nothing was printed)"
msgstr "(tiada output)"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "- and {n} more"
msgid_plural "- and {n} more"
msgstr[0] "- dan {n} lagi"

msgid ""
"1.00 is the normal size. Large text in Settings, Accessibility sets 1.25."
msgstr ""
"1.00 ialah saiz biasa. Teks Besar dalam Tetapan, Accessibility "
"(Kebolehcapaian) menetapkan 1.25."

msgid "12 hour"
msgstr "12 jam"

msgid "24 hour"
msgstr "24 jam"

msgid ""
"A .deb driver can't be installed. The window says how to get the .rpm from "
"the maker."
msgstr ""
"Pemacu .deb tidak dapat dipasang. Tetingkap ini memberitahu cara mendapatkan "
"fail .rpm daripada pengeluarnya."

msgid "A USB mouse works."
msgstr "Tetikus USB berfungsi."

msgid "A USB webcam works."
msgstr "Kamera web USB berfungsi."

msgid "A VPN"
msgstr "VPN"

msgid "A Windows program you downloaded (.exe or .msi)"
msgstr "Program Windows yang anda muat turun (.exe atau .msi)"

msgid "A background service fails"
msgstr "Perkhidmatan latar belakang gagal"

msgid ""
"A background service that runs on this computer fails to start (the mobile "
"broadband service, or the graphics switching service)."
msgstr ""
"Perkhidmatan latar belakang yang berjalan pada komputer ini gagal dimulakan "
"(perkhidmatan jalur lebar mudah alih atau perkhidmatan pensuisan grafik)."

msgid "A bottom bar, with a start menu on the logo"
msgstr "Bar bawah, dengan menu mula pada logo"

msgid "A broken app box"
msgstr "Kotak aplikasi yang rosak"

msgid "A built-in camera of the newer laptop kind was found."
msgstr "Kamera terbina dalam jenis komputer riba baharu telah ditemui."

msgid "A café, hotel, airport, or anywhere else. Nothing gets in."
msgstr ""
"Kafe, hotel, lapangan terbang, atau di mana-mana sahaja. Tiada apa-apa yang "
"boleh masuk."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "A certificate needs attention"
msgid_plural "{n} certificates need attention"
msgstr[0] "{n} sijil memerlukan perhatian"

msgid ""
"A change to the boot options is waiting. It starts at your next restart. It isn't an update.\n"
"\n"
"If you don't want it: Don't use it. The computer starts with the boot options it has now, and automatic updates aren't paused.\n"
"\n"
"Or Keep it."
msgstr ""
"Perubahan pada pilihan but sedang menunggu. Ia akan bermula pada kali seterusnya anda memulakan semula. Ini bukan kemas kini.\n"
"\n"
"Jika anda tidak mahukannya: Jangan gunakannya. Komputer bermula dengan pilihan but yang ada sekarang, dan kemas kini automatik tidak dijeda.\n"
"\n"
"Atau Kekalkan."

msgid "A device"
msgstr "Peranti"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "A device lost its driver ({driver})"
msgstr "Peranti kehilangan pemacunya ({driver})"

msgid "A disk is hidden."
msgstr "Cakera disembunyikan."

msgid "A driver file from the maker"
msgstr "Fail pemacu daripada pengeluar"

msgid "A file of recent errors to email to your helper"
msgstr "Fail ralat terkini untuk dihantar melalui e-mel kepada pembantu anda"

msgid "A full name can't have : or , in it."
msgstr "Nama penuh tidak boleh mengandungi : atau , di dalamnya."

msgid "A graphics chip has no driver."
msgstr "Cip grafik tiada pemacu."

msgid ""
"A network is only needed for automatic time and time zone. To use Wi-Fi, "
"click a network. Or click Next to go on without it."
msgstr ""
"Rangkaian hanya diperlukan untuk waktu dan zon waktu automatik. Untuk "
"menggunakan Wi-Fi, klik pada rangkaian. Atau klik Seterusnya untuk meneruskan"
" tanpanya."

msgid ""
"A new layout shows after you log out and back in. It changes only your own "
"desktop."
msgstr ""
"Susun atur baharu akan dipaparkan selepas anda log keluar dan log masuk "
"semula. Ia hanya menukar desktop anda sendiri."

msgid "A new system is ready."
msgstr "Sistem baharu sudah sedia."

msgid "A new system is ready. Restart to use it."
msgstr "Sistem baharu sudah sedia. Mulakan semula untuk menggunakannya."

msgid ""
"A new system version is used from the next restart. Keep working, and restart"
" when it suits you."
msgstr ""
"Versi sistem baharu akan digunakan mulai permulaan semula seterusnya. "
"Teruskan bekerja, dan mulakan semula apabila sesuai untuk anda."

msgid ""
"A new version also goes back if something that worked before is broken after "
"you log in, like sound, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, the camera or printing. Unplugged "
"or switched-off things don't count."
msgstr ""
"Versi baharu juga akan dikembalikan jika ada sesuatu yang sebelum ini "
"berfungsi tetapi rosak selepas anda log masuk, seperti bunyi, Wi-Fi, "
"Bluetooth, kamera atau pencetakan. Perkara yang dicabut plag atau dimatikan "
"tidak dikira."

msgid "A new version is ready"
msgstr "Versi baharu sudah sedia"

msgid ""
"A note at the next login says so and names what broke, and automatic updates "
"pause for 3 days."
msgstr ""
"Nota pada log masuk seterusnya memaklumkan perkara ini dan menyebut apa yang "
"rosak, serta kemas kini automatik dijeda selama 3 hari."

msgid ""
"A rollback test copy is running. Restart first, so the computer goes back to "
"the usual version."
msgstr ""
"Salinan ujian pemulihan sedang berjalan. Mulakan semula dahulu supaya "
"komputer kembali kepada versi biasa."

msgid "A security certificate expired, expires within 30 days, or was removed."
msgstr ""
"Sijil keselamatan telah tamat tempoh, akan tamat tempoh dalam masa 30 hari, "
"atau telah dibuang."

msgid "A slideshow of your own pictures"
msgstr "Tayangan slaid gambar anda sendiri"

msgid "A sound chip was found, but it didn't start."
msgstr "Cip bunyi ditemui, tetapi ia tidak berjaya dihidupkan."

msgid "A start-up check fails"
msgstr "Semakan permulaan gagal"

msgid ""
"A start-up check fails on purpose. The computer restarts by itself within "
"seconds, twice, and the third start is back on this version."
msgstr ""
"Semakan permulaan gagal secara sengaja. Komputer akan bermula semula dengan "
"sendirinya dalam masa beberapa saat, sebanyak dua kali, dan pada permulaan "
"ketiga ia akan kembali kepada versi ini."

msgid "A system service fails"
msgstr "Perkhidmatan sistem gagal"

msgid "A system update is also waiting for a restart."
msgstr "Kemas kini sistem juga sedang menunggu untuk dimulakan semula."

msgid "A tool"
msgstr "Alat"

msgid "A top bar, with the logo menu at the top left"
msgstr "Bar atas, dengan menu logo di bahagian atas kiri"

msgid ""
"A user name uses small letters, digits, - and _, and starts with a letter."
msgstr ""
"Nama pengguna menggunakan huruf kecil, angka, - dan _, serta bermula dengan "
"huruf."

msgid ""
"A wired network is set to Home, so this happens on any cable you plug in."
msgstr ""
"Rangkaian berwayar ditetapkan kepada Rumah, jadi ini berlaku pada mana-mana "
"kabel yang anda pasang."

msgid "A wireless chip was found, but it didn't start."
msgstr "Cip wayarles ditemui, tetapi ia tidak berjaya dihidupkan."

msgid "A wireless chip was found, with no driver for it."
msgstr "Cip wayarles ditemui, tetapi tiada pemacu untuknya."

msgid "AMD: flicker, turn off Panel Replay"
msgstr "AMD: berkelip, matikan Panel Replay"

msgid "AMD: flicker, turn off Panel Self Refresh"
msgstr "AMD: berkelip, matikan Panel Self Refresh"

msgid "AMD: flicker, turn off both"
msgstr "AMD: berkelip, matikan kedua-duanya"

msgid "AMD: screen dims or shifts colors on its own"
msgstr "AMD: skrin malap atau warna berubah dengan sendirinya"

msgid "AMD: white flickering"
msgstr "AMD: berkelip putih"

msgid ""
"About 20 seconds after the login screen shows, the computer locks up. Hold "
"the power button until it turns off, then turn it on. After the second "
"freeze, the next start is back on this version."
msgstr ""
"Kira-kira 20 saat selepas skrin log masuk dipaparkan, komputer menjadi tidak "
"responsif. Tekan dan tahan butang kuasa sehingga ia mati, kemudian "
"hidupkannya semula. Selepas komputer membeku buat kali kedua, permulaan "
"seterusnya akan kembali kepada versi ini."

msgid "About it"
msgstr "Tentangnya"

msgid "About this driver"
msgstr "Tentang pemacu ini"

msgid "Accent color and wallpaper"
msgstr "Warna aksen dan kertas dinding"

msgid "Account"
msgstr "Akaun"

msgid "Add"
msgstr "Tambah"

msgid "Add a folder"
msgstr "Tambah folder"

msgid "Add a folder and set the sharing password below."
msgstr "Tambah folder dan tetapkan kata laluan perkongsian di bawah."

msgid "Add a folder from your home folder."
msgstr "Tambah folder daripada folder utama anda."

msgid "Add a printer"
msgstr "Tambah pencetak"

msgid "Add a setting, like amdgpu.abmlevel=0"
msgstr "Tambah tetapan, seperti amdgpu.abmlevel=0"

msgid "Add anyway"
msgstr "Tambah juga"

msgid "Add it"
msgstr "Tambahkannya"

msgid ""
"Add it only if you know you need it. If the computer then won't start, "
"automatic rollback goes back to the version before."
msgstr ""
"Tambahkannya hanya jika anda tahu anda memerlukannya. Jika selepas itu "
"komputer tidak dapat dihidupkan, pemulihan automatik akan kembali kepada "
"versi sebelumnya."

msgid "Add or remove an app's hardware rules"
msgstr "Tambah atau buang peraturan perkakasan bagi aplikasi"

msgid "Add or remove media codecs"
msgstr "Tambah atau buang kodek media"

msgid "Add the media codecs"
msgstr "Tambah kodek media"

msgid "Add to the system"
msgstr "Tambah ke sistem"

msgid "Add video and audio codecs"
msgstr "Tambah kodek video dan audio"

msgid "Add, turn on or remove a VPN or an app's background service"
msgstr ""
"Tambah, hidupkan atau buang VPN atau perkhidmatan latar belakang aplikasi"

msgid "Added by you"
msgstr "Ditambah oleh anda"

msgid "Added to this computer"
msgstr "Ditambah pada komputer ini"

msgid "Adding a printer, and printer driver files from the maker"
msgstr "Menambah pencetak, dan fail pemacu pencetak daripada pengeluar"

msgid ""
"Adding the desktop parts apps expect (progress windows and notifications)"
msgstr ""
"Menambah bahagian desktop yang dijangkakan oleh aplikasi (tetingkap kemajuan "
"dan pemberitahuan)"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Adding the download source {name}"
msgstr "Menambah sumber muat turun {name}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Adding {title} to the system"
msgstr "Menambah {title} ke sistem"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Adding {title} to the system from Fedora. A progress window shows it."
msgstr ""
"Menambah {title} ke sistem daripada Fedora. Tetingkap kemajuan "
"menunjukkannya."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Adding {title} to the system from Fedora. This can take a few minutes."
msgstr ""
"Menambah {title} ke sistem daripada Fedora. Ini mungkin mengambil masa "
"beberapa minit."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Adding {title} to the system. A progress window shows it."
msgstr "Menambah {title} ke sistem. Tetingkap kemajuan menunjukkannya."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Adding {title} to the system. This can take a few minutes."
msgstr "Menambah {title} ke sistem. Ini mungkin mengambil masa beberapa minit."

msgid "Administrator"
msgstr "Pentadbir"

msgid "Administrator account (root)"
msgstr "Akaun pentadbir (root)"

msgid "Administrator: no."
msgstr "Pentadbir: tidak."

msgid "Administrator: yes."
msgstr "Pentadbir: ya."

msgid ""
"After a BIOS update, it may ask for the disk password again. Turn it on again"
" here."
msgstr ""
"Selepas kemas kini BIOS, ia mungkin meminta kata laluan cakera sekali lagi. "
"Hidupkannya semula di sini."

msgid ""
"After an undo, so the same update doesn't come straight back. They turn back "
"on by themselves."
msgstr ""
"Selepas pembatalan, supaya kemas kini yang sama tidak muncul semula serta-"
"merta. Ia dihidupkan semula dengan sendirinya."

msgid "After the restart, you will be asked to add your printer."
msgstr ""
"Selepas permulaan semula, anda akan diminta untuk menambah pencetak anda."

msgid ""
"After the restart, you'll be asked for your password once, to turn it on."
msgstr ""
"Selepas permulaan semula, anda akan diminta memasukkan kata laluan anda "
"sekali untuk menghidupkannya."

msgid "After the restart, you'll get a message when it's ready."
msgstr ""
"Selepas permulaan semula, anda akan mendapat mesej apabila ia sudah sedia."

msgid "Alpha"
msgstr "Alfa"

msgid "Also let in, on Home"
msgstr "Turut dibenarkan masuk, pada Rumah"

msgid ""
"Alt+Tab switches between apps. Alt and the key above Tab switches between "
"windows of the same app."
msgstr ""
"Alt+Tab bertukar antara aplikasi. Alt dan kekunci di atas Tab bertukar antara"
" tetingkap dalam aplikasi yang sama."

msgid ""
"An .rpm or .deb installs the app. An .exe or .msi gets its Linux version."
msgstr ""
"Fail .rpm atau .deb memasang aplikasi. Fail .exe atau .msi akan mendapat "
"versi Linuxnya."

msgid "An app that comes as a .rpm or .deb file"
msgstr "Aplikasi yang disediakan sebagai fail .rpm atau .deb"

msgid "An office. Nothing gets in, and your folders aren't shared."
msgstr "Pejabat. Tiada apa-apa yang masuk, dan folder anda tidak dikongsi."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"An update from {staged} is waiting. It starts at your next restart. The version you're using now is from {booted}.\n"
"\n"
"If you don't want it: Don't use it. Your computer keeps the version it has now. A boot options change made since the update came is dropped with it."
msgstr ""
"Kemas kini dari {staged} sedang menunggu. Ia akan bermula pada kali seterusnya anda memulakan semula. Versi yang anda gunakan sekarang adalah dari {booted}.\n"
"\n"
"Jika anda tidak mahukannya: Jangan gunakannya. Komputer anda mengekalkan versi yang ada sekarang. Perubahan pada pilihan but yang dibuat sejak kemas kini tiba akan dibuang bersama-sama dengannya."

msgid "An update is waiting for a restart. Restart first, then run the test."
msgstr ""
"Kemas kini sedang menunggu untuk dimulakan semula. Mulakan semula dahulu, "
"kemudian jalankan ujian."

msgid "Another disk is hidden by a BIOS setting."
msgstr "Satu lagi cakera disembunyikan oleh tetapan BIOS."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Another install or removal is running ({doing}). This waits for it to finish,"
" then goes on."
msgstr ""
"Pemasangan atau pembuangan lain sedang berjalan ({doing}). Ini menunggu "
"sehingga ia selesai, kemudian meneruskan."

msgid ""
"Another version is set to start at your next restart (after Undo the last "
"update, or picking a version in the boot menu), so the test wouldn't test "
"anything. Restart first, then run the test."
msgstr ""
"Versi lain ditetapkan untuk dimulakan pada kali seterusnya anda memulakan "
"semula (selepas Batalkan kemas kini terakhir, atau memilih versi dalam menu "
"but), jadi ujian itu tidak akan menguji apa-apa. Mulakan semula dahulu, "
"kemudian jalankan ujian."

msgid "App"
msgstr "Aplikasi"

msgid "App, game or port number"
msgstr "Aplikasi, permainan atau nombor port"

msgid ""
"Applies them at login: the next slide for \"at each login\", and dark or "
"light for the time of day"
msgstr ""
"Menerapkannya semasa log masuk: slaid seterusnya untuk \"Setiap kali log "
"masuk\", dan gelap atau cerah mengikut waktu"

msgid "Apps"
msgstr "Aplikasi"

msgid "Apps and ports let in"
msgstr "Aplikasi dan port yang dibenarkan masuk"

msgid "Apps from Bazaar have this setting inside the app."
msgstr "Aplikasi daripada Bazaar mempunyai tetapan ini di dalam aplikasi."

msgid "Apps from Bazaar update on their own. Remove them in Bazaar too."
msgstr ""
"Aplikasi daripada Bazaar dikemas kini secara automatik. Buangnya di Bazaar "
"juga."

msgid "Apps from Bazaar: open Bazaar and remove it there."
msgstr "Aplikasi daripada Bazaar: buka Bazaar dan buangnya di sana."

msgid ""
"Apps from a file, Get a VPN or a Windows program: Wheelhouse, Apps, Remove "
"apps."
msgstr ""
"Aplikasi daripada fail, Dapatkan VPN atau program Windows: Wheelhouse, "
"Aplikasi, Buang aplikasi."

msgid ""
"Apps from a file: open Wheelhouse, Apps, Start apps at login, and pick the "
"app. Picking it again stops it."
msgstr ""
"Aplikasi daripada fail: buka Wheelhouse, Aplikasi, Mulakan aplikasi semasa "
"log masuk, dan pilih aplikasi. Memilihnya sekali lagi akan menghentikannya."

msgid "Apps from package files"
msgstr "Aplikasi daripada fail pakej"

msgid "Apps from their own download sources"
msgstr "Aplikasi daripada sumber muat turunnya sendiri"

msgid "Apps you added from files, Get a VPN or Windows programs"
msgstr ""
