msgid ""
"Automatic updates are off: nothing updates until you run System Update yourself.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Turn on. Everything then updates by itself every day at 4 am, and updates fix security problems."
msgstr ""
"Kemas kini automatik dimatikan: tiada apa-apa yang akan dikemas kini sehingga anda menjalankan Kemas Kini Sistem sendiri.\n"
"\n"
"Disyorkan: Hidupkan. Semuanya kemudian akan dikemas kini dengan sendirinya setiap hari pada pukul 4 pagi, dan kemas kini membetulkan masalah keselamatan."

msgid "Automatic updates are on."
msgstr "Kemas kini automatik dihidupkan."

msgid ""
"Automatic updates are on: everything updates by itself every day at 4 am.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Keep them on. Updates fix security problems.\n"
"\n"
"Or Turn off: nothing updates until you run System Update yourself."
msgstr ""
"Kemas kini automatik dihidupkan: semuanya dikemas kini dengan sendirinya setiap hari pada pukul 4 pagi.\n"
"\n"
"Disyorkan: Biarkan ia dihidupkan. Kemas kini membetulkan masalah keselamatan.\n"
"\n"
"Atau Matikan: tiada apa-apa yang akan dikemas kini sehingga anda menjalankan Kemas Kini Sistem sendiri."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Automatic updates are paused until {day}"
msgstr "Kemas kini automatik dijeda sehingga {day}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Automatic updates are paused until {day}, after an undo, so the bad update doesn't come back. They turn back on by themselves.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Keep the pause.\n"
"\n"
"Or Resume now: the next daily update runs as normal. Or Turn off: nothing updates until you run System Update yourself."
msgstr ""
"Kemas kini automatik dijeda sehingga {day}, selepas pembatalan, supaya kemas kini yang bermasalah tidak kembali. Ia akan dihidupkan semula dengan sendirinya.\n"
"\n"
"Disyorkan: Kekalkan jeda.\n"
"\n"
"Atau Sambung sekarang: kemas kini harian seterusnya akan dijalankan seperti biasa. Atau Matikan: tiada apa-apa yang akan dikemas kini sehingga anda menjalankan Kemas Kini Sistem sendiri."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Automatic updates are paused until {day}, so the bad update doesn't come "
"back. They turn back on by themselves."
msgstr ""
"Kemas kini automatik dijeda sehingga {day}, supaya kemas kini yang bermasalah"
" tidak kembali. Ia akan dihidupkan semula dengan sendirinya."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Automatic updates are paused until {day}, so the same update doesn't come "
"straight back. They turn back on by themselves."
msgstr ""
"Kemas kini automatik dijeda sehingga {day}, supaya kemas kini yang sama tidak"
" terus kembali. Ia akan dihidupkan semula dengan sendirinya."

msgid ""
"Automatic updates are still paused after the undo. Resume them in Automatic "
"updates."
msgstr ""
"Kemas kini automatik masih dijeda selepas pembatalan. Sambung semula dalam "
"Kemas kini automatik."

msgid ""
"Automatic updates could not be paused, so the next one may bring the update "
"back. If it does, turn off Automatic updates in Wheelhouse and tell your "
"helper."
msgstr ""
"Kemas kini automatik tidak dapat dijeda, jadi kemas kini seterusnya mungkin "
"akan membawa kemas kini itu kembali. Jika ia berlaku, matikan Kemas kini "
"automatik dalam Wheelhouse dan beritahu pembantu anda."

msgid ""
"Automatic updates pause for 3 days, so the same update doesn't come straight "
"back. They turn back on by themselves."
msgstr ""
"Kemas kini automatik dijeda selama 3 hari, jadi kemas kini yang sama tidak "
"akan kembali serta-merta. Ia akan dihidupkan semula dengan sendirinya."

msgid ""
"Automatic updates then pause for 3 days, so the bad update doesn't come "
"straight back. If the problem returns after that, turn off Automatic updates "
"in Wheelhouse and tell your helper."
msgstr ""
"Kemas kini automatik kemudian dijeda selama 3 hari, supaya kemas kini yang "
"bermasalah tidak kembali serta-merta. Jika masalah berulang selepas itu, "
"matikan Kemas kini automatik dalam Wheelhouse dan beritahu pembantu anda."

msgid "Automatic updates, undoing an update, firmware and certificate alerts"
msgstr ""
"Kemas kini automatik, membatalkan kemas kini, amaran perisian tegar dan sijil"

