msgid ""
"Click Add a folder and pick it. It starts as Read only: change it to Read and"
" write if the other computer should save there too."
msgstr ""
"Klik Tambah folder, kemudian pilih folder tersebut. Ia bermula sebagai Baca "
"sahaja: tukar kepada Baca dan tulis jika komputer lain juga perlu menyimpan "
"di situ."

msgid "Click Apply, then Keep Changes if it looks right."
msgstr ""
"Klik Laksana, kemudian Kekalkan Perubahan jika semuanya kelihatan betul."

msgid "Click Back to the original to undo all of it."
msgstr "Klik Kembali ke asal untuk membatalkan semuanya."

msgid ""
"Click Free up disk space, then Free up space. Your files and apps aren't "
"touched."
msgstr ""
"Klik Kosongkan ruang cakera, kemudian klik Kosongkan ruang. Fail dan aplikasi"
" anda tidak disentuh."

msgid ""
"Click Install the driver, type your password, and restart. Then add the "
"printer."
msgstr ""
"Klik Pasang pemacu, taip kata laluan anda, dan mulakan semula. Kemudian "
"tambah pencetak."

msgid "Click Install, and it installs that instead."
msgstr "Klik Pasang, dan ia akan memasang itu sebaliknya."

msgid ""
"Click Let an app in, type its name, like Minecraft or Jellyfin, and click it."
msgstr ""
"Klik Benarkan aplikasi masuk, taipkan namanya, seperti Minecraft atau "
"Jellyfin, kemudian klik padanya."

msgid ""
"Click Restart to start EvenKeelOS. Click Save the log to put the details of "
"this install on a second USB stick."
msgstr ""
"Klik Mulakan semula untuk memulakan EvenKeelOS. Klik Simpan log untuk "
"menyimpan butiran pemasangan ini pada pemacu kilat USB kedua."

msgid ""
"Click Save details. It makes one file of recent errors, in Documents. Nothing"
" is sent anywhere."
msgstr ""
"Klik Simpan butiran. Ia akan mencipta satu fail yang mengandungi ralat "
"terkini, di dalam folder Dokumen. Tiada apa-apa yang dihantar ke mana-mana."

msgid "Click Show the file, then attach it to an email to your helper."
msgstr ""
"Klik Tunjukkan fail, kemudian lampirkan fail tersebut pada e-mel kepada "
"pembantu anda."

msgid "Click Test to hear each speaker."
msgstr "Klik Uji untuk mendengar setiap pembesar suara."

msgid "Click Turn off or Turn on. Turning them off asks for your password."
msgstr ""
"Klik Matikan atau Hidupkan. Jika anda mematikannya, anda akan diminta "
"memasukkan kata laluan anda."

msgid "Click Turn on, type the disk password once, and restart."
msgstr "Klik Hidupkan, taip kata laluan cakera sekali, dan mulakan semula."

msgid ""
"Click Undo the update, type your password, and restart. Your files and apps "
"aren't touched."
msgstr ""
"Klik Batalkan kemas kini, taip kata laluan anda, dan mulakan semula. Fail dan"
" aplikasi anda tidak disentuh."

msgid ""
"Click a font to pick another, or change Text size. 1.00 is the normal size."
msgstr ""
"Klik fon untuk memilih fon lain, atau ubah Saiz teks. 1.00 ialah saiz biasa."

msgid "Click the USB stick to save them on."
msgstr "Klik pemacu kilat USB untuk menyimpannya di situ."

msgid ""
"Click the clock to see your notifications and the calendar. Or press Windows "
"key + V."
msgstr ""
"Klik jam untuk melihat pemberitahuan anda dan kalendar. Atau tekan kekunci "
"Windows + V."

msgid "Click the copy button next to a command, then paste it in Terminal."
msgstr ""
"Klik butang salin di sebelah arahan, kemudian tampalkannya dalam Terminal."

msgid "Click the device's name when it shows in the list."
msgstr "Klik nama peranti apabila ia muncul dalam senarai."

msgid ""
"Click the icons at the end of the bar, then the arrow next to Wi-Fi. Or open "
"Settings, Wi-Fi."
msgstr ""
"Klik ikon di hujung bar, kemudian klik anak panah di sebelah Wi-Fi. Atau buka"
" Tetapan, Wi-Fi."

msgid ""
"Click the icons at the end of the bar: the bottom right with the Windows-"
"style layout, the top right with the standard one. Or press Windows key + S."
msgstr ""
"Klik ikon di hujung bar: di bahagian kanan bawah untuk susun atur gaya "
"Windows, di bahagian kanan atas untuk susun atur standard. Atau tekan kekunci"
" Windows + S."

msgid ""
"Click the magnifying glass, or press Ctrl+F, and type to search this folder "
"and the folders in it."
msgstr ""
"Klik ikon kaca pembesar, atau tekan Ctrl+F, kemudian taip untuk mencari dalam"
" folder ini dan folder di dalamnya."

msgid "Click the meeting link you were sent."
msgstr "Klik pautan mesyuarat yang dihantar kepada anda."

msgid "Click the network's name, type its password, and press Enter."
msgstr "Klik nama rangkaian, taip kata laluannya, dan tekan Enter."

msgid ""
"Click the printer when it shows, then Add. Most printers need nothing else."
msgstr ""
"Klik pencetak apabila ia muncul, kemudian klik Tambah. Kebanyakan pencetak "
"tidak memerlukan apa-apa lagi."

