#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Some important system settings were broken, and putting them back didn't fix the start, so your computer went back to the version from {since}, which has its own settings. Your files and apps aren't touched, and automatic updates aren't paused.\n"
"\n"
"Tell your helper. Save problem details in Wheelhouse makes a file to send them."
msgstr ""
"Beberapa tetapan sistem penting rosak, dan memulihkannya tidak membetulkan permulaan, jadi komputer anda kembali kepada versi dari {since}, yang mempunyai tetapannya sendiri. Fail dan aplikasi anda tidak disentuh, dan kemas kini automatik tidak dijeda.\n"
"\n"
"Beritahu pembantu anda. Simpan butiran masalah dalam Wheelhouse mencipta fail untuk dihantar kepada mereka."

msgid ""
"Some video formats (like most web video) need extra codecs that Fedora, and "
"this system, leave out because of patents in some countries. Installing them "
"is your choice and your responsibility.\\n\\nWeb video only: lets Firefox "
"play most web video. A small addition to the system.\\n\\nEverything: plays "
"all common video and audio, in every app. It replaces some parts of the "
"system, so system updates take a little longer.\\n\\nNot now: they're in "
"Wheelhouse, Apps, Media codecs, any time.\\n\\nPick by what you need. If you "
"only watch video in Firefox, Web video only is enough."
msgstr ""
"Sesetengah format video (seperti kebanyakan video web) memerlukan kodek "
"tambahan yang tidak disertakan oleh Fedora dan sistem ini kerana paten di "
"sesetengah negara. Memasangnya adalah pilihan dan tanggungjawab "
"anda.\\n\\nVideo web sahaja: membolehkan Firefox memainkan kebanyakan video "
"web. Tambahan kecil kepada sistem.\\n\\nSemuanya: memainkan semua video dan "
"audio biasa, dalam setiap aplikasi. Ia menggantikan beberapa bahagian sistem,"
" jadi kemas kini sistem mengambil masa sedikit lebih lama.\\n\\nBukan "
"sekarang: ia ada dalam Wheelhouse, Aplikasi, Kodek media, pada bila-bila "
"masa.\\n\\nPilih mengikut apa yang anda perlukan. Jika anda hanya menonton "
"video dalam Firefox, Video web sahaja sudah mencukupi."

msgid ""
"Some video formats, like most web video, need media codecs that aren't part of the system. The next window explains the choices.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Next. Or Skip: they're in Wheelhouse, Apps, Media codecs, any time."
msgstr ""
"Sesetengah format video, seperti kebanyakan video web, memerlukan kodek media yang bukan sebahagian daripada sistem. Tetingkap seterusnya menerangkan pilihan-pilihan tersebut.\n"
"\n"
"Disyorkan: Seterusnya. Atau Langkau: ia ada di Wheelhouse, Aplikasi, Kodek media, pada bila-bila masa."

msgid ""
"Some, like printer drivers, are added to the system: they're ready after the "
"next restart."
msgstr ""
"Sesetengahnya, seperti pemacu pencetak, ditambah ke sistem: ia sedia "
"digunakan selepas permulaan semula seterusnya."

