msgid "That folder belongs to someone else."
msgstr "Folder itu milik orang lain."

msgid "That folder has no pictures in it (JPEG, PNG or WebP)."
msgstr "Folder itu tidak mengandungi gambar (JPEG, PNG atau WebP)."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "That folder is already shared, as {name}."
msgstr "Folder itu sudah dikongsi, sebagai {name}."

msgid "That folder isn't shared."
msgstr "Folder itu tidak dikongsi."

msgid "That folder wasn't found."
msgstr "Folder itu tidak ditemui."

msgid "That folder's name can't be shared. Rename it or pick another."
msgstr ""
"Nama folder itu tidak boleh dikongsi. Namakan semula atau pilih yang lain."

msgid "That isn't let in here."
msgstr "Itu tidak dibenarkan masuk di sini."

msgid "That isn't the disk password, so nothing was changed. Try again."
msgstr ""
"Itu bukan kata laluan cakera, jadi tiada apa-apa yang diubah. Cuba sekali "
"lagi."

msgid ""
"That was the wrong disk password too many times, so it's locked for an hour. "
"Nothing was changed. Try again after that."
msgstr ""
"Kata laluan cakera itu salah terlalu banyak kali, jadi ia dikunci selama satu"
" jam. Tiada apa-apa yang diubah. Cuba sekali lagi selepas itu."

msgid ""
"The BIOS screen uses the keyboard. When you're done, choose Save and Exit, or"
" Exit."
msgstr ""
"Skrin BIOS menggunakan papan kekunci. Apabila anda selesai, pilih Save and "
"Exit, atau Exit."

msgid ""
"The BIOS's RAID setting (Intel RST) hides the disk. Restart into the BIOS and"
" set the storage mode (often called SATA mode or SATA operation) to AHCI. "
"Windows on this disk won't start after that change, but installing EvenKeelOS"
" erases it anyway."
msgstr ""
"Tetapan RAID BIOS (Intel RST) menyembunyikan cakera. Mulakan semula ke BIOS "
"dan tetapkan mod storan (selalunya dipanggil SATA mode atau SATA operation) "
"kepada AHCI. Windows pada cakera ini tidak akan bermula selepas perubahan "
"itu, tetapi memasang EvenKeelOS tetap akan memadamnya."

msgid "The Bluetooth driver is blocked, so there's no Bluetooth."
msgstr "Pemacu Bluetooth disekat, jadi tiada Bluetooth."

msgid ""
"The NVIDIA card runs on the open-source driver built into EvenKeelOS. The "
"proprietary NVIDIA driver isn't used: it breaks too often to keep the promise"
" that EvenKeelOS just works. If you need it, use Bazzite or Bluefin's NVIDIA "
"editions instead."
msgstr ""
"Kad NVIDIA berjalan menggunakan pemacu sumber terbuka yang terbina dalam "
"EvenKeelOS. Pemacu NVIDIA proprietari tidak digunakan: ia rosak terlalu kerap"
" untuk memenuhi janji bahawa EvenKeelOS berfungsi dengan lancar. Jika anda "
"memerlukannya, gunakan edisi NVIDIA Bazzite atau Bluefin sebagai gantinya."

msgid "The QR code could not be made. Save the log to a stick instead."
msgstr "Kod QR tidak dapat dibuat. Sebaliknya, simpan log pada pemacu kilat."

msgid "The USB stick could not be opened."
msgstr "Pemacu kilat USB tidak dapat dibuka."

msgid "The VPN list is missing."
msgstr "Senarai VPN tiada."

msgid "The Wi-Fi card's driver is blocked, so there's no Wi-Fi."
msgstr "Pemacu kad Wi-Fi disekat, jadi tiada Wi-Fi."

msgid "The administrator password was not given, so nothing was changed."
msgstr "Kata laluan pentadbir tidak diberikan, jadi tiada apa-apa yang diubah."

msgid "The administrator password wasn't given, so nothing was changed."
msgstr "Kata laluan pentadbir tidak diberikan, jadi tiada apa-apa yang diubah."

msgid "The app system (Flatpak)"
msgstr "Sistem aplikasi (Flatpak)"

msgid "The app's instructions say TCP, UDP or both"
msgstr "Arahan aplikasi menyebut TCP, UDP atau kedua-duanya"

msgid "The automatic rollback test worked."
msgstr "Ujian pemulihan automatik berjaya."

msgid ""
"The automatic update is already running, so this window follows it until it's"
" done. You can keep working."
msgstr ""
"Kemas kini automatik sudah berjalan, jadi tetingkap ini akan mengikutinya "
"sehingga selesai. Anda boleh teruskan bekerja."

msgid ""
"The battery is at %s%% and the computer isn't plugged in. If the battery runs"
" out during the update, the update is lost and has to start "
"again.\\n\\nRecommended: Not now. Plug the computer in, then start System "
"Update again.\\n\\nOr Update anyway."
msgstr ""
"Bateri pada %s%% dan komputer tidak disambungkan kepada bekalan kuasa. Jika "
"bateri habis semasa kemas kini, kemas kini itu hilang dan perlu dimulakan "
"semula.\\n\\nDisyorkan: Bukan sekarang. Sambungkan komputer kepada bekalan "
"kuasa, kemudian mulakan Kemas Kini Sistem sekali lagi.\\n\\nAtau Kemas kini "
"juga."

msgid ""
"The battery is at %s%%. Plug the computer in: if it runs out during the "
"update, the update is lost."
msgstr ""
"Bateri pada %s%%. Sambungkan komputer kepada bekalan kuasa: jika bateri habis"
" semasa kemas kini, kemas kini itu hilang."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The biggest disk holds {gb} GB."
msgstr "Cakera terbesar mempunyai {gb} GB."

msgid "The boot entry is already named %s. Nothing to do."
msgstr "Entri but sudah dinamakan %s. Tiada apa-apa yang perlu dilakukan."

msgid "The boot options can't be read right now"
msgstr "Pilihan but tidak dapat dibaca sekarang"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The boot options didn't change: {reason}"
msgstr "Pilihan but tidak berubah: {reason}"

msgid "The boot options the computer starts with couldn't be read."
msgstr "Pilihan but yang digunakan komputer untuk bermula tidak dapat dibaca."

msgid "The box is missing or broken."
msgstr "Kotak tiada atau rosak."

msgid ""
"The buttons at a window's top right minimize, maximize and close it, as on "
"Windows."
msgstr ""
"Butang di bahagian atas kanan tetingkap berfungsi untuk meminimumkan, "
"memaksimumkan dan menutup tetingkap, sama seperti di Windows."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The camera ({device})"
msgstr "Kamera ({device})"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The certificate \"{name}\" was added to this computer and has been removed, "
"so it's no longer trusted. If you didn't remove it, tell your helper."
msgstr ""
"Sijil \"{name}\" telah ditambah pada komputer ini dan kemudiannya dibuang, "
"jadi ia tidak lagi dipercayai. Jika anda tidak membuangnya, beritahu pembantu"
" anda."

msgid "The certificates couldn't be checked."
msgstr "Sijil tidak dapat disemak."

msgid "The change was not made, and nothing was left behind."
msgstr "Perubahan tidak dibuat, dan tiada apa-apa yang tertinggal."

msgid "The check couldn't finish."
msgstr "Semakan tidak dapat diselesaikan."

msgid "The clock and time zone settings could not be saved."
msgstr "Tetapan jam dan zon waktu tidak dapat disimpan."

msgid ""
"The codecs are installed. They start working after a restart, which the setup"
" checklist offers at its end."
msgstr ""
"Kodek sudah dipasang. Ia mula berfungsi selepas permulaan semula, yang "
"ditawarkan oleh senarai semak persediaan pada penghujungnya."

msgid ""
"The codecs are installed.\\n\\nRecommended: Restart now to start using them. "
"Or Later."
msgstr ""
"Kodek telah dipasang.\\n\\nDisyorkan: Mulakan semula sekarang untuk mula "
"menggunakannya. Atau Nanti."

msgid "The codecs are removed. Restart to finish."
msgstr "Kodek telah dibuang. Mulakan semula untuk menyelesaikannya."

msgid "The codecs weren't removed."
msgstr "Kodek tidak dibuang."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The computer didn't start properly with the boot options changed in "
"Wheelhouse, so it went back to the version from {since}, with the boot "
"options it had before."
msgstr ""
"Komputer tidak berjaya dimulakan dengan betul apabila pilihan but diubah "
"dalam Wheelhouse, jadi ia kembali kepada versi dari {since}, dengan pilihan "
"but yang ada sebelum ini."

msgid ""
"The computer hasn't saved a copy of its settings since this start yet. Wait a"
" few minutes and try again. If it keeps saying this, tell your helper: the "
"copy isn't being saved."
msgstr ""
"Komputer belum menyimpan salinan tetapannya sejak permulaan ini. Tunggu "
"beberapa minit dan cuba sekali lagi. Jika ia terus mengatakan ini, beritahu "
"pembantu anda: salinan tidak disimpan."

msgid "The computer locks up"
msgstr "Komputer menjadi tidak responsif"

msgid ""
"The computer may not start, or may lose its drive, memory or processors."
msgstr ""
"Komputer mungkin tidak dapat dihidupkan, atau mungkin kehilangan pemacu, "
"memori atau pemprosesnya."

msgid ""
"The computer restarts and opens its BIOS settings screen. Save your work first.\n"
"\n"
"The BIOS settings are used with the keyboard. When you're done, choose Save and Exit, or Exit, to start the computer again."
msgstr ""
"Komputer dimulakan semula dan membuka skrin tetapan BIOS. Simpan kerja anda terlebih dahulu.\n"
"\n"
"Tetapan BIOS dikendalikan menggunakan papan kekunci. Apabila anda selesai, pilih Save and Exit, atau Exit, untuk memulakan komputer semula."

msgid ""
"The computer restarts, fails on purpose, then goes back by itself. A note at "
"login says the test worked and what the test copy found broken."
msgstr ""
"Komputer dimulakan semula, sengaja gagal, kemudian kembali ke keadaan asal "
"dengan sendirinya. Nota semasa log masuk memberitahu bahawa ujian berjaya dan"
" apa yang ditemui rosak oleh salinan ujian."

msgid "The computer starts with the usual settings."
msgstr "Komputer bermula dengan tetapan biasa."

msgid ""
"The computer would start without the desktop: a text screen or a rescue "
"shell."
msgstr "Komputer akan bermula tanpa desktop: skrin teks atau shell pemulihan."

msgid "The desktop"
msgstr "Desktop"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The device rule wasn't added, so the device may not work.\n"
"\n"
"{details}"
msgstr ""
"Peraturan peranti tidak ditambah, jadi peranti mungkin tidak berfungsi.\n"
"\n"
"{details}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The device rule wasn't added, so the device may not work.\n"
"{details}"
msgstr ""
"Peraturan peranti tidak ditambah, jadi peranti mungkin tidak berfungsi.\n"
"{details}"

msgid "The disk is full. Free some space, then try again."
msgstr "Cakera penuh. Kosongkan sedikit ruang, kemudian cuba sekali lagi."

msgid "The disk is hidden by a BIOS setting."
msgstr "Cakera disembunyikan oleh tetapan BIOS."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The disk {disk} was not found, or can't be written to."
msgstr "Cakera {disk} tidak ditemui, atau tidak boleh ditulis."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The download source stays. Open {filename} again to pick an app, or remove it"
" in Wheelhouse, Apps, Remove apps."
msgstr ""
"Sumber muat turun kekal. Buka {filename} sekali lagi untuk memilih aplikasi, "
"atau buangnya dalam Wheelhouse, Aplikasi, Buang aplikasi."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The download source was added, but it has no apps to show right now. Check "
"your internet connection, then open {filename} again."
msgstr ""
"Sumber muat turun telah ditambah, tetapi ia tiada aplikasi untuk dipaparkan "
"buat masa ini. Semak sambungan internet anda, kemudian buka {filename} sekali"
" lagi."

msgid ""
"The earlier version doesn't have the settings repair yet, so if the repair "
"didn't work, going back to it would give a wrong message. Run the test after "
"the next update."
msgstr ""
"Versi terdahulu belum ada pembaikan tetapan. Jadi, jika pembaikan tidak "
"berjaya, kembali ke versi itu akan memaparkan mesej yang salah. Jalankan "
"ujian selepas kemas kini seterusnya."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The file could not be written: {error}."
msgstr "Fail tidak dapat ditulis: {error}."

msgid "The fingerprint reader"
msgstr "Pembaca cap jari"

msgid "The firewall"
msgstr "Tembok api"

msgid "The firewall didn't reload."
msgstr "Tembok api tidak dimuat semula."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The firewall didn't take the change: {reason}"
msgstr "Tembok api tidak menerima perubahan: {reason}"

msgid "The firewall doesn't start"
msgstr "Tembok api tidak bermula"

msgid ""
"The firewall fails to start, so during the test the computer has no firewall."
msgstr ""
"Tembok api gagal dimulakan, jadi semasa ujian komputer tidak mempunyai tembok"
" api."

msgid "The firewall isn't answering"
msgstr "Tembok api tidak memberi respons"

msgid "The firmware update didn't finish. Try again later."
msgstr "Kemas kini perisian tegar tidak selesai. Cuba lagi kemudian."

msgid "The firmware updater"
msgstr "Pengemas kini perisian tegar"

msgid ""
"The first meeting asks whether to install Chrome or use your usual browser."
msgstr ""
"Mesyuarat pertama bertanya sama ada anda mahu memasang Chrome atau "
"menggunakan penyemak imbas biasa anda."

msgid ""
"The first time, choose Install Chrome or Use the usual browser. The meeting "
"opens in Zoom's web version."
msgstr ""
"Pada kali pertama, pilih Pasang Chrome atau Gunakan penyemak imbas biasa. "
"Mesyuarat dibuka dalam versi web Zoom."

msgid "The full codecs are already installed. Restart if you have not yet."
msgstr ""
"Kodek penuh sudah dipasang. Mulakan semula jika anda belum berbuat demikian."

msgid "The full guide"
msgstr "Panduan penuh"

msgid "The full name is empty."
msgstr "Nama penuh kosong."

msgid ""
"The graphics driver is blocked, so the screen runs in a basic mode: it may "
"look blurry or slow, or stay black (then just wait)."
msgstr ""
"Pemacu grafik disekat, jadi skrin beroperasi dalam mod asas: ia mungkin "
"kelihatan kabur atau perlahan, atau kekal hitam (dalam keadaan itu, tunggu "
"sahaja)."

msgid "The install could not be finished."
msgstr "Pemasangan tidak dapat diselesaikan."

msgid "The install stopped"
msgstr "Pemasangan terhenti"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The installer could not start: {error}"
msgstr "Pemasang tidak dapat dimulakan: {error}"

msgid "The installer couldn't open. Use Install EvenKeelOS in the dock."
msgstr "Pemasang tidak dapat dibuka. Gunakan Pasang EvenKeelOS dalam dok."

msgid "The installer stopped unexpectedly."
msgstr "Pemasang terhenti secara tiba-tiba."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The keyboard ({device})"
msgstr "Papan kekunci ({device})"

msgid "The last lines of the log:"
msgstr "Baris terakhir log:"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The last start failed its start-up checks, and some system settings were missing or replaced. Your computer put back {n} from the copy it saved {saved}, then restarted. Your files and apps aren't touched.\n"
"\n"
"Put back: {what}.\n"
"\n"
"If it happens again, tell your helper. Save problem details in Wheelhouse makes a file to send them."
msgid_plural ""
"The last start failed its start-up checks, and some system settings were missing or replaced. Your computer put back {n} from the copy it saved {saved}, then restarted. Your files and apps aren't touched.\n"
"\n"
"Put back: {what}.\n"
"\n"
"If it happens again, tell your helper. Save problem details in Wheelhouse makes a file to send them."
msgstr[0] ""
"Permulaan terakhir gagal dalam semakan permulaan, dan beberapa tetapan sistem tiada atau telah diganti. Komputer anda mengembalikan {n} daripada salinan yang disimpannya {saved}, kemudian dimulakan semula. Fail dan aplikasi anda tidak disentuh.\n"
"\n"
"Dikembalikan: {what}.\n"
"\n"
"Jika ia berlaku lagi, beritahu pembantu anda. Simpan butiran masalah dalam Wheelhouse mencipta fail untuk dihantar kepada mereka."

msgid "The layout didn't change."
msgstr "Susun atur tidak berubah."

msgid ""
"The layout, colors, wallpaper, dark at night, fonts, screen size, night "
"light, sound and accounts"
msgstr ""
"Susun atur, warna, kertas dinding, mod gelap pada waktu malam, fon, saiz "
"skrin, cahaya malam, bunyi dan akaun"

msgid "The login screen doesn't start"
msgstr "Skrin log masuk tidak bermula"

msgid ""
"The login screen fails to start, so you never see it. The computer restarts "
"by itself within seconds, twice, and the third start is back on this version."
msgstr ""
"Skrin log masuk gagal dimulakan, jadi anda tidak pernah melihatnya. Komputer "
"bermula semula dengan sendirinya dalam masa beberapa saat, sebanyak dua kali,"
" dan pada permulaan ketiga, ia kembali ke versi ini."

msgid ""
"The login screen works, but logging in drops you back to it. Log in a second "
"time; after the second drop the computer restarts by itself. Do that on 2 "
"starts, and the third start is back on this version."
msgstr ""
"Skrin log masuk berfungsi, tetapi apabila anda log masuk, anda dikembalikan "
"ke skrin log masuk semula. Log masuk sekali lagi; selepas kembali ke skrin "
"log masuk buat kali kedua, komputer akan bermula semula dengan sendirinya. "
"Lakukan itu pada 2 kali permulaan, dan permulaan ketiga akan kembali ke versi"
" ini."

msgid "The media codecs start working after a restart."
msgstr "Kodek media mula berfungsi selepas permulaan semula."

msgid ""
"The menu that opens has Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, the sound volume, the screen "
"brightness, the power mode, dark style and night light."
msgstr ""
"Menu yang terbuka mempunyai Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, kelantangan bunyi, kecerahan "
"skrin, mod kuasa, gaya gelap dan cahaya malam."

msgid "The new files could not be labelled."
msgstr "Fail baharu tidak dapat dilabelkan."

msgid "The new partitions did not show up."
msgstr "Partisyen baharu tidak muncul."

msgid "The new system could not be set to take signed updates."
msgstr ""
"Sistem baharu tidak dapat ditetapkan untuk menerima kemas kini "
"bertandatangan."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The new system has no {name} group."
msgstr "Sistem baharu ini tiada kumpulan {name}."

msgid "The new system's desktop layouts could not be found."
msgstr "Susun atur desktop sistem baharu tidak dapat ditemui."

msgid "The new system's settings database could not be found."
msgstr "Pangkalan data tetapan sistem baharu tidak ditemui."

msgid "The next network you join starts as a Public place."
msgstr ""
"Rangkaian seterusnya yang anda sertai akan bermula sebagai Tempat Awam."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The next start uses: {settings}"
msgstr "Permulaan seterusnya menggunakan: {settings}"

msgid "The one-time setup window is already closed."
msgstr "Tetingkap persediaan sekali sahaja sudah ditutup."

msgid "The password is typed and matches."
msgstr "Kata laluan telah ditaip dan sepadan."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The password wasn't saved: {reason}"
msgstr "Kata laluan tidak disimpan: {reason}"

msgid ""
"The picture is copied, ready to paste, and saved in Pictures, Screenshots."
msgstr ""
"Gambar telah disalin, sedia untuk ditampal, dan disimpan dalam Gambar, "
"Screenshots."

msgid ""
"The power button in that menu has Suspend, Restart, Power Off and Log Out."
msgstr ""
"Butang kuasa dalam menu itu mempunyai Tangguh, Restart (Mula Semula), Matikan"
" dan Log Out (Daftar Keluar)."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The printer driver {title} is ready."
msgstr "Pemacu pencetak {title} sudah sedia."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The printer driver {title} is ready.\n"
"\n"
"Open Printers: choose Add Printer, then your printer."
msgstr ""
"Pemacu pencetak {title} sudah sedia.\n"
"\n"
"Buka Pencetak: pilih Tambah Pencetak, kemudian pilih pencetak anda."

msgid "The printing service fails to start."
msgstr "Perkhidmatan pencetakan gagal dimulakan."

msgid "The restart didn't start"
msgstr "Permulaan semula tidak berlaku"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The restart said:\n"
"\n"
"{message}\n"
"\n"
"Exit code: {code}"
msgstr ""
"Permulaan semula melaporkan:\n"
"\n"
"{message}\n"
"\n"
"Kod keluar: {code}"

msgid ""
"The root account is the system's own administrator. Most people never need "
"it: your own account can be an administrator instead."
msgstr ""
"Akaun root ialah pentadbir sistem itu sendiri. Kebanyakan orang tidak pernah "
"memerlukannya: akaun anda sendiri boleh menjadi pentadbir sebagai gantinya."

msgid "The root password could not be set."
msgstr "Kata laluan root tidak dapat ditetapkan."

msgid "The screen flashes white, often with an outside display"
msgstr "Skrin berkelip putih, selalunya bersama paparan luaran"

msgid ""
"The settings are deleted, but the computer didn't restart. Restart it now: "
"the next start puts them back."
msgstr ""
"Tetapan telah dihapuskan, tetapi komputer tidak dimulakan semula. Mulakan "
"semula sekarang: permulaan seterusnya akan mengembalikannya."

msgid "The settings repair test didn't work."
msgstr "Ujian pembaikan tetapan tidak berjaya."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The settings repair test didn't work: your computer couldn't put the deleted settings back, so it went back to the version from {since}, which has its own settings. Your files and apps aren't touched, and automatic updates aren't paused.\n"
"\n"
"Tell your helper. Save problem details in Wheelhouse makes a file to send them."
msgstr ""
"Ujian pembaikan tetapan tidak berjaya: komputer anda tidak dapat mengembalikan tetapan yang dihapuskan, jadi ia kembali kepada versi dari {since}, yang mempunyai tetapannya sendiri. Fail dan aplikasi anda tidak disentuh, dan kemas kini automatik tidak dijeda.\n"
"\n"
"Beritahu pembantu anda. Simpan butiran masalah dalam Wheelhouse mencipta fail untuk dihantar kepada mereka."

msgid "The settings repair test worked."
msgstr "Ujian pembaikan tetapan berjaya."

msgid "The sound chip's driver is blocked, so there's no sound."
msgstr "Pemacu cip bunyi disekat, jadi tiada bunyi."

msgid ""
"The start menu, windows, the menu at the end of the bar, notifications, "
"screenshots and shortcuts"
msgstr ""
"Menu mula, tetingkap, menu di hujung bar, pemberitahuan, tangkapan skrin dan "
"pintasan"

msgid "The sun doesn't set or rise here today, so it's dark until it rises."
msgstr ""
"Matahari tidak terbenam atau terbit di sini hari ini, jadi keadaan gelap "
"sehingga ia terbit."

msgid "The sun doesn't set or rise here today, so it's light until it sets."
msgstr ""
"Matahari tidak terbenam atau terbit di sini hari ini, jadi keadaan cerah "
"sehingga ia terbenam."

msgid "The system core crashed (a protection fault)"
msgstr "Teras sistem ranap (ralat perlindungan)"

msgid "The system core crashed (an oops)"
msgstr "Teras sistem ranap (ralat \"oops\")"

msgid "The system core reported a bug"
msgstr "Teras sistem melaporkan pepijat"

msgid ""
"The system itself can't be changed by apps or by mistake. Each update "
"replaces it whole."
msgstr ""
"Sistem itu sendiri tidak boleh diubah oleh aplikasi atau secara tidak "
"sengaja. Setiap kemas kini menggantikannya sepenuhnya."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The test copy ({name}) is ready. It starts at your next restart."
msgstr ""
"Salinan ujian ({name}) sudah siap. Ia akan bermula pada kali seterusnya anda "
"memulakan semula."

msgid ""
"The test marker is removed. The version without it starts at your next "
"restart."
msgstr ""
"Penanda ujian telah dibuang. Versi tanpanya akan dimulakan pada kali "
"seterusnya anda memulakan semula."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The test worked. At the next start your computer found important settings missing, put back {n} setting from the copy it saved {saved}, and restarted by itself.\n"
"\n"
"Put back: {what}."
msgid_plural ""
"The test worked. At the next start your computer found important settings missing, put back {n} settings from the copy it saved {saved}, and restarted by itself.\n"
"\n"
"Put back: {what}."
msgstr[0] ""
"Ujian berjaya. Pada permulaan seterusnya, komputer anda mendapati tetapan penting tiada, mengembalikan {n} tetapan daripada salinan yang disimpannya {saved}, dan dimulakan semula dengan sendirinya.\n"
"\n"
"Dikembalikan: {what}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The test worked. Your computer went back by itself to the version from "
"{since}, and the test copy is removed."
msgstr ""
"Ujian berjaya. Komputer anda kembali sendiri kepada versi dari {since}, dan "
"salinan ujian telah dibuang."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The touchpad ({device})"
msgstr "Pad sentuh ({device})"

msgid "The two don't match yet."
msgstr "Kedua-duanya belum sepadan."

msgid "The update did not finish. Details: journalctl -u %s"
msgstr "Kemas kini tidak selesai. Butiran: journalctl -u %s"

msgid "The update didn't finish."
msgstr "Kemas kini tidak selesai."

msgid ""
"The update didn't finish. Nothing is broken: your computer keeps running the "
"version it has.\\n\\nTry again later."
msgstr ""
"Kemas kini tidak selesai. Tiada apa-apa yang rosak: komputer anda terus "
"menggunakan versi yang ada sekarang.\\n\\nCuba lagi kemudian."

msgid "The update program"
msgstr "Program kemas kini"

msgid ""
"The update program is swapped for one that always fails (until the next "
"restart; nothing on the disk changes)."
msgstr ""
"Program kemas kini ditukar kepada program yang sentiasa gagal (sehingga "
"permulaan semula seterusnya; tiada apa-apa pada cakera yang berubah)."

msgid "The user name is empty."
msgstr "Nama pengguna kosong."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The version you're using now is from {current}. The one from before it, from {older}, is still on this computer.\n"
"\n"
"If something stopped working after the last update: Undo the update. The version from {older} starts at your next restart. Your files and your apps aren't touched."
msgstr ""
"Versi yang anda gunakan sekarang adalah dari {current}. Versi sebelum itu, dari {older}, masih ada pada komputer ini.\n"
"\n"
"Jika ada sesuatu yang berhenti berfungsi selepas kemas kini terakhir: Batalkan kemas kini. Versi dari {older} akan bermula pada kali seterusnya anda memulakan semula komputer. Fail dan aplikasi anda tidak disentuh."

msgid ""
"The version you're using now is the one before it with boot options changed in Wheelhouse.\n"
"\n"
"Undo the change: the computer starts with the boot options it had before, at your next restart. Automatic updates aren't paused.\n"
"\n"
"Or Cancel."
msgstr ""
"Versi yang anda gunakan sekarang ialah versi sebelum ini dengan pilihan but yang diubah dalam Wheelhouse.\n"
"\n"
"Batalkan perubahan: komputer akan bermula dengan pilihan but yang ada sebelum ini, pada kali seterusnya anda memulakan semula. Kemas kini automatik tidak dijeda.\n"
"\n"
"Atau Batal."

msgid "The wallpaper changes to the next picture in a folder of yours."
msgstr "Kertas dinding bertukar kepada gambar seterusnya dalam folder anda."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The {fs} file system could not be loaded, so the disk can't be prepared."
msgstr ""
"Sistem fail {fs} tidak dapat dimuatkan, jadi cakera tidak dapat disediakan."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {label} is deleted."
msgstr "{label} telah dihapuskan."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {label} is not working."
msgstr "{label} tidak berfungsi."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {label} is repaired."
msgstr "{label} telah dibaiki."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The {label} isn't working.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Repair the box. It rebuilds the box, puts your apps back, then installs {title}. Your files aren't touched."
msgstr ""
"{label} tidak berfungsi.\n"
"\n"
"Disyorkan: Baiki kotak. Ia membina semula kotak, mengembalikan aplikasi anda, kemudian memasang {title}. Fail anda tidak disentuh."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {name} ({unit})"
msgstr "{name} ({unit})"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {name} graphics drive the screen."
msgstr "Grafik {name} mengendalikan skrin."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {name} service ({unit})"
msgstr "Perkhidmatan {name} ({unit})"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {title} download isn't signed by ArtCraft, so it was not installed."
msgstr ""
"Muat turun {title} tidak ditandatangani oleh ArtCraft, jadi ia tidak "
"dipasang."

msgid "There are no app boxes to repair."
msgstr "Tiada kotak aplikasi untuk dibaiki."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "There is no start-up keyboard layout for {layout}."
msgstr "Tiada susun atur papan kekunci permulaan untuk {layout}."

msgid ""
"There's no earlier version on this computer to go back to. Only the version "
"you're using now is kept."
msgstr ""
"Tiada versi terdahulu pada komputer ini untuk dikembalikan. Hanya versi yang "
"anda gunakan sekarang yang disimpan."

msgid ""
"There's no earlier version to fall back to if putting the settings back "
"doesn't work, so the test doesn't run. Try it after the next update."
msgstr ""
"Tiada versi terdahulu untuk kembali jika memulihkan tetapan tidak berjaya, "
"jadi ujian tidak dijalankan. Cuba selepas kemas kini seterusnya."

msgid "These security certificates need attention. Pick one to see what to do."
msgstr ""
"Sijil keselamatan ini memerlukan perhatian. Pilih satu untuk melihat apa yang"
" perlu dilakukan."

msgid "They open in Chrome."
msgstr "Ia dibuka dalam Chrome."

msgid "They open in your usual browser. Choose to be asked about Chrome again."
msgstr ""
"Ia dibuka dalam penyemak imbas biasa anda. Pilih untuk ditanya tentang Chrome"
" sekali lagi."

msgid "This account can't share folders."
msgstr "Akaun ini tidak boleh berkongsi folder."

msgid ""
"This computer asks for the disk password every time it starts. The computer's security chip can unlock the disk instead.\n"
"\n"
"This needs the disk password, so it's one for your helper.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Set it up. Or Skip: it's in Wheelhouse any time."
msgstr ""
"Komputer ini meminta kata laluan cakera setiap kali ia dihidupkan. Cip keselamatan komputer boleh membuka kunci cakera sebagai gantinya.\n"
"\n"
"Ini memerlukan kata laluan cakera, jadi ia untuk pembantu anda.\n"
"\n"
"Disyorkan: Sediakan. Atau Langkau: ia ada di Wheelhouse pada bila-bila masa."

msgid ""
"This computer can't go back by itself: it was installed before automatic "
"rollback was added, or automatic rollback was switched off. Computers "
"installed from a newer USB have it."
msgstr ""
"Komputer ini tidak boleh kembali ke keadaan asal dengan sendirinya: ia "
"dipasang sebelum pemulihan automatik ditambah, atau pemulihan automatik "
"dimatikan. Komputer yang dipasang daripada USB yang lebih baharu "
"mempunyainya."

msgid ""
"This computer can't open its BIOS settings from here. Press the BIOS key "
"while it starts (often F2, F10, F12 or Delete)."
msgstr ""
"Komputer ini tidak boleh membuka tetapan BIOSnya dari sini. Tekan kekunci "
"BIOS semasa ia bermula (biasanya F2, F10, F12 atau Delete)."

msgid ""
"This computer has no security chip (TPM) that can do this, so the disk "
"password stays."
msgstr ""
"Komputer ini tiada cip keselamatan (TPM) yang boleh melakukan perkara ini, "
"jadi kata laluan cakera kekal ada."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This computer is running a test copy ({name}) as its normal version, so a new test can't start from it.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Remove the test marker. The version without it starts at your next restart. Needs your password."
msgstr ""
"Komputer ini menggunakan salinan ujian ({name}) sebagai versi biasanya, jadi ujian baharu tidak boleh dimulakan daripadanya.\n"
"\n"
"Disyorkan: Buang penanda ujian. Versi tanpa penanda itu akan bermula pada kali seterusnya anda memulakan semula. Ia memerlukan kata laluan anda."

msgid ""
"This computer is running a test copy. Open Test automatic rollback again to "
"remove its marker."
msgstr ""
"Komputer ini menjalankan salinan ujian. Buka Uji pemulihan automatik sekali "
"lagi untuk membuang penandanya."

msgid "This computer started the USB stick in old BIOS (legacy) mode."
msgstr "Komputer ini memulakan pemacu kilat USB dalam mod BIOS lama (legasi)."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This desktop uses {now}.\n"
"\n"
"Switch to {new}? It takes effect after you log out and back in.\n"
"\n"
"Or Keep it."
msgstr ""
"Desktop ini menggunakan {now}.\n"
"\n"
"Tukar kepada {new}? Perubahan ini berkuat kuasa selepas anda log keluar dan log masuk semula.\n"
"\n"
"Atau Kekalkan."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This file can't be installed. It may be damaged or not fully downloaded. Download it again and retry.\n"
"\n"
"(Details: {details})"
msgstr ""
"Fail ini tidak boleh dipasang. Ia mungkin rosak atau tidak dimuat turun sepenuhnya. Muat turun sekali lagi dan cuba semula.\n"
"\n"
"(Butiran: {details})"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This file is an older version of {title} than the one you have.\n"
"\n"
"Install the older version: replaces yours. Only do this if the newer one has a problem."
msgstr ""
"Fail ini ialah versi {title} yang lebih lama berbanding yang anda ada.\n"
"\n"
"Pasang versi yang lebih lama: ia akan menggantikan versi anda. Hanya lakukan ini jika versi yang lebih baharu ada masalah."

msgid ""
"This is a live session: it runs from the USB stick, nothing here is saved, "
"and the computer's disk isn't touched."
msgstr ""
"Ini ialah sesi langsung: ia berjalan daripada pemacu kilat USB, tiada apa-apa"
" di sini disimpan, dan cakera komputer tidak disentuh."

msgid ""
"This is how the computer shows up on your network. Keep the suggestion, or "
"type a new one."
msgstr ""
"Inilah cara komputer muncul dalam rangkaian anda. Kekalkan cadangan ini, atau"
" taip yang baharu."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This is the 32-bit version of {title}, for older computers. Download the "
"64-bit version instead (often called amd64 or x86_64)."
msgstr ""
"Ini ialah versi 32-bit {title}, untuk komputer lama. Sebaliknya, muat turun "
"versi 64-bit (selalunya dipanggil amd64 atau x86_64)."

msgid "This network"
msgstr "Rangkaian ini"

msgid ""
"This removes things the computer no longer needs: unused app parts, old "
"system update files, and unused container images. Your files and your apps "
"aren't touched."
msgstr ""
"Ini membuang perkara yang komputer tidak perlukan lagi: bahagian aplikasi "
"yang tidak digunakan, fail kemas kini sistem lama dan imej kontena yang tidak"
" digunakan. Fail dan aplikasi anda tidak disentuh."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This saves the computer's recent error messages, its system version and the list of your apps to one file, {name}, in your Documents folder. What your apps showed or opened isn't in it.\n"
"\n"
"Then email that file to your helper. They can see what went wrong without being here.\n"
"\n"
"Nothing is sent anywhere by itself."
msgstr ""
"Ini menyimpan mesej ralat komputer yang terkini, versi sistemnya dan senarai aplikasi anda ke dalam satu fail, {name}, di dalam folder Dokumen anda. Apa yang dipaparkan atau dibuka oleh aplikasi anda tidak ada di dalamnya.\n"
"\n"
"Kemudian e-melkan fail itu kepada pembantu anda. Mereka boleh melihat apa yang tidak kena tanpa berada di sini.\n"
"\n"
"Tiada apa-apa yang dihantar ke mana-mana dengan sendirinya."

msgid ""
"This sets what other devices on this network can reach. Pick Public place "
"anywhere you're not sure. You can change it later in Wheelhouse, Network "
"safety."
msgstr ""
"Ini menetapkan apa yang boleh dicapai oleh peranti lain dalam rangkaian ini. "
"Pilih Tempat Awam di mana-mana sahaja anda tidak pasti. Anda boleh "
"mengubahnya kemudian dalam Wheelhouse, Keselamatan rangkaian."

msgid ""
"This sets what you see at first. The next step suggests a desktop layout to "
"match, and the guide is in Wheelhouse, Get help, either way."
msgstr ""
"Ini menetapkan apa yang anda lihat pada mulanya. Langkah seterusnya "
"mencadangkan susun atur desktop yang sepadan, dan panduannya ada di "
"Wheelhouse, Dapatkan bantuan, walau apa pun pilihan anda."

msgid "This setting is risky"
msgstr "Tetapan ini berisiko"

msgid "This start found these broken, as the test expects:"
msgstr ""
"Permulaan ini mendapati item-item ini rosak, seperti yang dijangkakan oleh "
"ujian:"

msgid "This start found these still broken, as the test expects:"
msgstr ""
"Permulaan ini mendapati perkara ini masih rosak, seperti yang dijangkakan "
"oleh ujian:"

msgid "This system's EFI partition: %s (disk %s, partition %s)"
msgstr "Partisyen EFI sistem ini: %s (cakera %s, partisyen %s)"

msgid "This takes a while."
msgstr "Ini akan mengambil sedikit masa."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "This version is from {when}."
msgstr "Versi ini dari {when}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This {title} file is for a different kind of computer. Download the version "
"for this one (often called {names})."
msgstr ""
"Fail {title} ini adalah untuk jenis komputer yang berbeza. Muat turun versi "
"untuk yang ini (selalunya dipanggil {names})."

msgid ""
"Those are file sharing ports: folders are shared only on Home networks, in "
"Shared folders."
msgstr ""
"Ini ialah port perkongsian fail: folder hanya dikongsi dalam rangkaian Rumah,"
" dalam Folder dikongsi."

msgid "Thunderbolt or USB4 ports"
msgstr "Port Thunderbolt atau USB4"

msgid "Time server name"
msgstr "Nama pelayan masa"

msgid "Time servers"
msgstr "Pelayan masa"

msgid ""
"Time servers to use instead of Fedora's. Type a name and click Add. Click a "
"server to take it off. Click Back when done."
msgstr ""
"Pelayan masa yang akan digunakan menggantikan pelayan masa Fedora. Taip nama "
"dan klik Tambah. Klik pelayan untuk mengeluarkannya. Klik Kembali apabila "
"selesai."

msgid "Time zone"
msgstr "Zon waktu"

msgid "To be asked again: Wheelhouse, Apps, Zoom meetings."
msgstr "Untuk ditanya sekali lagi: Wheelhouse, Aplikasi, Mesyuarat Zoom."

msgid "To change your password, click Password."
msgstr "Untuk menukar kata laluan anda, klik Kata laluan."

msgid "To check that this works on your computer, see Getting help."
msgstr ""
"Untuk memastikan ini berfungsi pada komputer anda, lihat Mendapatkan bantuan."

msgid "To choose which apps can notify you: Settings, Notifications."
msgstr ""
"Untuk memilih aplikasi yang boleh menghantar pemberitahuan kepada anda: "
"Tetapan, Pemberitahuan."

msgid "To free the space for good: open Trash and click Empty."
msgstr ""
"Untuk mengosongkan ruang secara kekal: buka Tong Sampah dan klik Kosong."

msgid ""
"To get it back: open Trash in the left side of Files, right-click the file, "
"and choose Restore From Trash."
msgstr ""
"Untuk mendapatkannya semula: buka Tong Sampah di sebelah kiri Fail, klik "
"kanan pada fail, dan pilih Pulih Dari Tong Sampah."

msgid ""
"To give someone their own account, click Add User. Leave Administrator off "
"for children and guests."
msgstr ""
"Untuk memberikan seseorang akaun mereka sendiri, klik Tambah Pengguna. "
"Biarkan Pentadbir dimatikan untuk kanak-kanak dan tetamu."

msgid "To go on, click Erase and install. To pick another disk, click Back."
msgstr ""
"Untuk meneruskan, klik Padam dan pasang. Untuk memilih cakera lain, klik "
"Kembali."

msgid ""
"To make one: select the files, right-click, choose Compress, give it a name, "
"and click Create."
msgstr ""
"Untuk menciptanya: pilih fail, klik kanan, pilih Mampat, berikan nama, dan "
"klik Cipta."

msgid ""
"To open one: right-click it and choose Extract. The files go in a folder next"
" to it."
msgstr ""
"Untuk membukanya: klik kanan padanya dan pilih Extract (Ekstrak). Fail-fail "
"akan diletakkan dalam folder di sebelahnya."

msgid "To print, press Ctrl+P in any app."
msgstr "Untuk mencetak, tekan Ctrl+P dalam mana-mana aplikasi."

msgid ""
"To record a video instead, click the video camera icon in the same tool "
"before you start. Recordings go to Videos, Screencasts."
msgstr ""
"Jika anda mahu merakam video, klik ikon kamera video dalam alat yang sama "
"sebelum anda bermula. Rakaman akan disimpan di Video, Screencasts."

msgid "To update now: open Wheelhouse, Updates, System Update."
msgstr ""
"Untuk mengemas kini sekarang: buka Wheelhouse, Kemas kini, Kemas Kini Sistem."

msgid ""
"Told to add a setting by a helper? Type it under Your own settings. Risky "
"ones are explained first."
msgstr ""
"Disuruh menambah tetapan oleh pembantu? Taipkannya di bawah Tetapan anda "
"sendiri. Yang berisiko diterangkan dahulu."

msgid "Too weak"
msgstr "Terlalu lemah"

msgid "Tool"
msgstr "Alat"

msgid "Top bar, apps from the bottom dock"
msgstr "Bar atas, aplikasi daripada dok bawah"

msgid "Touchpad"
msgstr "Pad sentuh"

msgid "Touchpad found."
msgstr "Pad sentuh ditemui."

msgid ""
"Try again in a minute. If this stays, use Save problem details in Get help."
msgstr ""
"Cuba lagi dalam seminit. Jika ini berterusan, gunakan Simpan butiran masalah "
"dalam Dapatkan bantuan."

msgid "Try again later."
msgstr "Cuba lagi kemudian."

msgid "Try anyway"
msgstr "Cuba juga"

msgid "Try it first"
msgstr "Cuba dahulu"

msgid "Turn automatic updates off or on"
msgstr "Matikan atau hidupkan kemas kini automatik"

msgid "Turn it on"
msgstr "Hidupkan"

msgid ""
"Turn it on below, and computers on your Home network can open the folders you"
" pick."
msgstr ""
"Hidupkannya di bawah, dan komputer dalam rangkaian Rumah anda boleh membuka "
"folder yang anda pilih."

msgid "Turn it on from a Home network."
msgstr "Hidupkannya daripada rangkaian Rumah."

msgid "Turn off"
msgstr "Matikan"

msgid "Turn on"
msgstr "Hidupkan"

msgid "Turn on anyway"
msgstr "Hidupkan juga"

msgid ""
"Turn on automatic updates or automatic disk unlock, or free up disk space"
msgstr ""
"Hidupkan kemas kini automatik atau buka kunci cakera secara automatik, atau "
"kosongkan ruang cakera"

msgid ""
"Turn sharing off and on again. If this stays, use Save problem details in Get"
" help."
msgstr ""
"Matikan perkongsian, kemudian hidupkan semula. Jika ini berterusan, gunakan "
"Simpan butiran masalah dalam Dapatkan bantuan."

msgid ""
"Turn the printer on. Plug it in with its cable, or join it to the same Wi-Fi."
msgstr ""
"Hidupkan pencetak. Sambungkannya dengan kabelnya, atau sambungkannya ke Wi-Fi"
" yang sama."

msgid "Turn them on or off"
msgstr "Hidupkan atau matikan"

msgid "Turning automatic updates back on."
msgstr "Menghidupkan semula kemas kini automatik."

msgid "Turning off automatic disk unlock."
msgstr "Mematikan buka kunci cakera automatik."

msgid "Turning off automatic updates."
msgstr "Mematikan kemas kini automatik."

msgid "Turning on automatic disk unlock."
msgstr "Menghidupkan buka kunci cakera automatik."

msgid "Turning on automatic updates."
msgstr "Menghidupkan kemas kini automatik."

msgid "Turns off Panel Self Refresh"
msgstr "Mematikan Panel Self Refresh"

msgid "Turns off Panel Self Refresh and Panel Replay"
msgstr "Mematikan Panel Self Refresh dan Panel Replay"

msgid "Turns off adaptive backlight"
msgstr "Mematikan lampu latar adaptif"

msgid "Two choices:"
msgstr "Dua pilihan:"

msgid "Type a setting first."
msgstr "Taip tetapan dahulu."

msgid "Type it again"
msgstr "Taip sekali lagi"

msgid "Type it, then type it again below."
msgstr "Taipkannya, kemudian taipkannya sekali lagi di bawah."

msgid "Type the disk password (the one you type when the computer starts):"
msgstr ""
"Taip kata laluan cakera (kata laluan yang anda taip apabila komputer "
"dihidupkan):"

msgid "Type the disk password twice."
msgstr "Taip kata laluan cakera dua kali."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Type the password for {network}, then click Connect. Back goes to the list."
msgstr ""
"Taip kata laluan untuk {network}, kemudian klik Sambung. Kembali membawa anda"
" ke senarai."

msgid "Type the password twice."
msgstr "Taip kata laluan dua kali."

msgid ""
"Type your full name. Your user name is made from it; type over it to change "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Taipkan nama penuh anda. Nama pengguna anda dibentuk daripadanya; taip di "
"atasnya untuk menukarnya."

msgid "Type your password, then restart. The fix starts at the restart."
msgstr ""
"Taip kata laluan anda, kemudian mulakan semula. Pembaikan bermula semasa "
"permulaan semula."

msgid "USB drives and memory cards"
msgstr "Pemacu USB dan kad memori"

msgid "USB or Bluetooth headphones may still work."
msgstr "Fon kepala USB atau Bluetooth mungkin masih berfungsi."

msgid "USB stick"
msgstr "Pemacu kilat USB"

msgid "Ubuntu box"
msgstr "Kotak Ubuntu"

msgid "Undo it. See Updates and safety."
msgstr "Batalkan. Lihat Kemas kini dan keselamatan."

msgid "Undo the change"
msgstr "Batalkan perubahan"

msgid "Undo the last update"
msgstr "Batalkan kemas kini terakhir"

msgid "Undo the last update in Wheelhouse can still take you back later."
msgstr ""
"Batalkan kemas kini terakhir dalam Wheelhouse masih boleh membawa anda "
"kembali kemudian."

msgid "Undo the update"
msgstr "Batalkan kemas kini"

msgid "Unknown"
msgstr "Tidak diketahui"

