msgid ""
"Unlock disk automatically is on: the disk unlocks by itself when the computer starts.\n"
"\n"
"Turn off: you type the disk password at every start again."
msgstr ""
"Buka kunci cakera secara automatik dihidupkan: cakera akan dibuka kuncinya sendiri apabila komputer dihidupkan.\n"
"\n"
"Matikan: anda perlu menaip kata laluan cakera semula pada setiap kali permulaan."

msgid "Unplug the device and plug it back in so it works."
msgstr "Cabut peranti dan pasang semula supaya ia berfungsi."

msgid "Unsigned kernel drivers could load."
msgstr "Pemacu kernel yang tidak ditandatangani boleh dimuatkan."

