msgid "Welcome to EvenKeelOS"
msgstr "Selamat datang ke EvenKeelOS"

msgid ""
"Welcome. A few things to set up, one at a time.\n"
"\n"
"1. Media codecs, for web video\n"
"2. Skip the disk password at startup\n"
"3. How to get apps\n"
"\n"
"Each can be skipped.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Start. Or Later: this opens again at the next login. Or Don't show again: it's in Wheelhouse any time."
msgstr ""
"Selamat datang. Beberapa perkara untuk disediakan, satu demi satu.\n"
"\n"
"1. Kodek media, untuk video web\n"
"2. Langkau kata laluan cakera semasa permulaan\n"
"3. Cara mendapatkan aplikasi\n"
"\n"
"Setiap satu boleh dilangkau.\n"
"\n"
"Disyorkan: Mulakan. Atau Nanti: ini akan dibuka semula pada log masuk seterusnya. Atau Jangan tunjukkan lagi: ia ada dalam Wheelhouse pada bila-bila masa."

