"Windows programs (.exe and .msi) don't run here. Open one anyway: Wheelhouse "
"tells you the version for EvenKeelOS, or a replacement when there is one, and"
" installs it."
msgstr ""
"Program Windows (.exe dan .msi) tidak boleh dijalankan di sini. Buka sahaja: "
"Wheelhouse memberitahu anda versi untuk EvenKeelOS, atau penggantinya jika "
"ada, dan memasangnya."

