#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{name}: {steps}\n"
"\n"
"This really deletes these files from this computer: the user accounts and passwords (/etc/passwd, /etc/shadow, /etc/group, /etc/gshadow), the list of disks (/etc/fstab), the login rules (/etc/pam.d) and the administrator rules (/etc/sudoers). Your own files and apps aren't touched.\n"
"\n"
"Save your work and close your apps first: the computer restarts as soon as they're deleted.\n"
"\n"
"If putting them back doesn't work: when a start hangs or stays broken, hold the power button until the computer turns off, then turn it on. After 2 bad starts, the next start is the earlier version kept for Undo the last update, which has its own copy of these settings."
msgstr ""
"{name}: {steps}\n"
"\n"
"Ini benar-benar menghapuskan fail-fail ini daripada komputer ini: akaun pengguna dan kata laluan (/etc/passwd, /etc/shadow, /etc/group, /etc/gshadow), senarai cakera (/etc/fstab), peraturan log masuk (/etc/pam.d) dan peraturan pentadbir (/etc/sudoers). Fail dan aplikasi anda sendiri tidak disentuh.\n"
"\n"
"Simpan kerja anda dan tutup aplikasi anda terlebih dahulu: komputer akan dimulakan semula sebaik sahaja fail-fail itu dihapuskan.\n"
"\n"
"Jika mengembalikannya tidak berjaya: apabila permulaan tersekat atau kekal rosak, tekan dan tahan butang kuasa sehingga komputer mati, kemudian hidupkannya. Selepas 2 permulaan yang gagal, permulaan seterusnya ialah versi terdahulu yang disimpan untuk Batalkan kemas kini terakhir, yang mempunyai salinan tetapan ini sendiri."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{name}: {steps}\n"
"\n"
"When it comes back, a message says the test worked, and the test copy is removed. Don't turn the computer off during the test unless the steps say to. {save}\n"
"\n"
"The test copy takes the place of the earlier version kept for Undo the last update, so Undo has nothing to go back to until the next update."
msgstr ""
"{name}: {steps}\n"
"\n"
"Apabila ia kembali, mesej memberitahu bahawa ujian berjaya, dan salinan ujian dibuang. Jangan matikan komputer semasa ujian melainkan langkah-langkahnya menyuruh anda berbuat demikian. {save}\n"
"\n"
"Salinan ujian mengambil tempat versi terdahulu yang disimpan untuk Batalkan kemas kini terakhir, jadi Batalkan kemas kini terakhir tiada versi untuk kembali sehingga kemas kini seterusnya."

