#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "New defaults: wallpapers, accent folders, lock screen"
msgstr "Lalai baharu: kertas dinding, folder warna aksen, skrin kunci"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "New default: teal accent color, also on the login screen"
msgstr "Lalai baharu: warna aksen teal, juga pada skrin log masuk"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Fix rollback note, login-loop and stuck tests"
msgstr "Betulkan nota pemulihan, gelung log masuk dan ujian tersekat"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Fix freeze rollback and cut retries to 2"
msgstr "Betulkan pemulihan ketika beku dan kurangkan percubaan semula kepada 2"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Fix the automatic rollback tests"
msgstr "Betulkan ujian pemulihan automatik"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Real failure tests for automatic rollback"
msgstr "Ujian kegagalan sebenar untuk pemulihan automatik"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add automatic rollback with greenboot"
msgstr "Tambah pemulihan automatik dengan greenboot"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Start the Windows layout on the desktop, plus small fixes"
msgstr "Mulakan susun atur Windows pada desktop, serta pembetulan kecil"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Pause automatic updates for 3 days after an undo"
msgstr "Jeda kemas kini automatik selama 3 hari selepas buat asal"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add a Desktop layout step to the installer"
msgstr "Tambah langkah Susun atur desktop pada pemasang"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add Desktop layout to System Tools"
msgstr "Tambah Susun atur desktop pada Alat Sistem"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Keep power-mode switches from waiting on updates"
msgstr "Elakkan penukaran mod kuasa menunggu kemas kini"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add an optional Windows-style layout"
msgstr "Tambah susun atur gaya Windows pilihan"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Fix Fedora 45 presets and container policy paths"
msgstr "Betulkan pratetap Fedora 45 dan laluan dasar kontena"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Read download sources in Fedora 45's new folder"
msgstr "Baca sumber muat turun dalam folder baharu Fedora 45"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Move to Fedora 45"
msgstr "Beralih kepada Fedora 45"

msgid "Fonts and text size are back to EvenKeelOS's own."
msgstr "Fon dan saiz teks sudah kembali kepada asal EvenKeelOS."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Recommended: Delete the box. It comes back by itself the next time you install {apps}. Anything added to the box another way is deleted too. Your files are not touched."
msgstr "Disyorkan: Hapuskan kotak. Kotak akan muncul semula dengan sendirinya pada kali seterusnya anda memasang {apps}. Apa-apa sahaja yang ditambah ke dalam kotak melalui cara lain juga akan dihapuskan. Fail anda tidak disentuh."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Deleting it frees about {size}."
msgstr "Menghapuskannya membebaskan kira-kira {size}."
